  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rights based REDD+ Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: The international climate regime for land-use and forests includes a rights-based approach and provisions to protect natural ecosystems
&#x2022;	Outcome 2: Indigenous peoples and other forest-dependent communities enjoy greater respect for their land rights and are recognised for their sustainable management and protection of the rainforest.
Implementing partners: AMAN, PARADISEA,WALHI KALTENG,WARSI</narrative>
  </description>
